{
  "name": "Playnite-Store",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "Games Nexus Playnite extension - provides store catalog, downloads, and game management for Playnite with full theme integration support",
  "memory": {
    "enabled": true,
    "files": [
      "AGENTS.md",
      ".opencode/memory/architecture.md",
      ".opencode/memory/theme-api.md"
    ]
  },
  "agents": {
    "instructions": "AGENTS.md"
  },
  "customInstructions": [
    "KEY ARCHITECTURE: Extension should NOT hijack the main panel in Fullscreen mode. Exposes GamesNexusCatalog on Application.Current.Resources. Themes provide their own XAML UI and bind to GamesNexusCatalog resource.",
    "Extension registers sidebar item as fallback for Desktop mode only.",
    "Theme's StoreOverlay toggled by ToggleStoreButton checkbox in Main.xaml",
    "COMMANDS EXPOSED TO THEMES: IsStoreOpen, ToggleStoreCommand, SelectGameByIdCommand, DownloadRepackCommand, FilterByGenreCommand, FilterBySourceCommand, FilterByPlatformCommand, SortByCommand, SearchCommand, LoadNextPageCommand",
    "PROPERTIES FOR THEMES: Games, StatusText, StatusTotalText, IsLoading, HasMore, CurrentSortBy, CurrentSortDesc, CurrentHasRepacks",
    "THEME ELEMENTS EXTENSION LOOKS FOR: ToggleStoreButton (CheckBoxEx), StoreOverlay (Grid), GamesNexusStorePanel (ContentControl)"
  ]
}
